WEBVTT

00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:07.650
Handa's lack of trust in others
has recently gotten worse.

00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:10.270
I ran into Kawafuji by accident...

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:12.790
It seems like it got worse

00:00:12.790 --> 00:00:15.890
after the rough treatment his classmates
put him through to restore his memory.

00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:17.660
What if someone sees me?

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:19.680
At this rate, Handa is going to ruin himself.

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:20.830
I'll be killed for sure...

00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:24.690
Oh, that's it? Scared me there.

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:28.140
I need to do something about this
without letting him off the hook.

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:31.350
Let's go out and play after school.

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:31.930
Huh?

00:00:45.970 --> 00:00:48.520
Just tell me! Too many choices to make...

00:00:48.530 --> 00:00:51.100
What is the answer? More than I can handle...

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:53.440
I don't know anymore! Got too much liberty...

00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:55.980
Just tell me!! Right now!!

00:00:56.190 --> 00:00:58.860
Get my words, take my rights!

00:00:58.880 --> 00:01:01.240
Unable to put up with this inescapable reality,

00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:01.360
Get my words, take my rights!
Unable to put up with this inescapable reality,

00:01:01.360 --> 00:01:03.700
Get my words, take my rights!

00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:06.160
Everyone's lying to themselves!

00:01:06.320 --> 00:01:08.660
After all this grieving... wailing...

00:01:08.660 --> 00:01:10.950
has something managed to change?

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:13.830
We run away before the fight even starts,

00:01:13.830 --> 00:01:16.840
as a sorrowful yesterday enters refrain.

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:22.720
Get up now! These twised emotions have nowhere to go-

00:01:22.760 --> 00:01:25.390
It's a problem everyone faces

00:01:25.390 --> 00:01:27.850
unable to even sleep at night!

00:01:27.850 --> 00:01:29.060
C'mon and Break down!

00:01:29.060 --> 00:01:32.690
Abandon any half-assed resolutions!

00:01:32.950 --> 00:01:37.480
Whether this future can be broken through, or not- you'll never know unless you try!

00:01:37.480 --> 00:01:43.030
Searching for an answer, even questioning the times you live in,

00:01:43.030 --> 00:01:47.410
No one is going to give you an answer!

00:01:47.410 --> 00:01:53.210
So let loose that feeling engraved in your heart-

00:01:53.210 --> 00:01:57.040
Choose your liberty... and take it in hand!

00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:09.310
<i>"Handa-kun and His Friend's Friend"</i>

00:02:09.310 --> 00:02:11.230
Sorry, Kawafuji. Did I keep you waiting?

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:12.190
You're late...

00:02:12.190 --> 00:02:13.020
Let's go.

00:02:15.650 --> 00:02:16.780
Handa?

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:17.530
Yeah.

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:20.280
There's no telling who's watching, after all.

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:21.160
Where's your school uniform?

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:22.450
Inside my bag.

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:26.160
With my perfect disguise, I can now enjoy life!

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:27.370
Now hold on there.

00:02:27.870 --> 00:02:29.000
Oh... Sorry about that.

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:31.040
Kawa-chan!

00:02:31.880 --> 00:02:32.710
Did I keep you waiting?

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:35.420
Thanks for hanging out with me.

00:02:35.420 --> 00:02:36.840
I didn't have anything better to do anyway.

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:37.840
I was careless...

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:38.470
Gonna play like there's no tomorrow!

00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:40.090
Kawafuji never actually said he
and I were the only ones going out.

00:02:40.090 --> 00:02:41.470
Why are you so excited?

00:02:41.470 --> 00:02:41.640
Kawafuji never actually said he
and I were the only ones going out.

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:43.680
This is Hasegawa, from my class.

00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:45.850
Despite being a runt, he's in the
basketball club, and an idol otaku to boot.

00:02:45.850 --> 00:02:47.020
Don't call me a runt!

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:48.520
And the long haired guy there is Han—

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:49.730
The name's Hanzawa!

00:02:49.730 --> 00:02:50.730
Nice to see you.

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:50.810
I need to protect Kawafuji's good name.

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:52.940
Huh, Hanzawa-kun?
You're in the same school as us?

00:02:53.650 --> 00:02:55.570
I didn't know we had an
unusual character like him.

00:02:55.570 --> 00:02:56.230
Uh...

00:02:56.230 --> 00:02:57.900
I went to school in America!

00:02:57.900 --> 00:02:59.990
No way! Seriously?!
You can speak English?!

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:04.910
"I was forced to realize how lonely I am."

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:08.160
Amazing! Not that I understood what you said.

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:11.080
Handa never betrays my expectations.

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:12.210
Let's go!

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:16.800
Kawafuji, I don't think
I can go through with this.

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:19.090
There's no need for you to hide your identity.

00:03:19.550 --> 00:03:20.930
He's a really nice guy.

00:03:20.930 --> 00:03:24.180
I just wanted you to make some friends.

00:03:24.720 --> 00:03:25.970
Kawafuji...

00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:27.930
You really are a nice guy.

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:31.480
There they are! They're so cute!

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:33.650
Triple Apple straps!

00:03:33.650 --> 00:03:35.150
The campaign for them ends today.

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:35.320
Bowling
Basketball
Darts

00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:38.150
You can get them if you win
at three games, so...

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:39.280
I'm counting on you both!

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:40.070
What?!

00:03:40.070 --> 00:03:41.110
Leave it to us.

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:43.160
Let's go, Hantani. Or was it Hangawa?

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:45.660
Darts, basketball, bowling...

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:47.950
I've never played any of them before.

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:51.460
Let's start with bowling!

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:54.630
You need to knock down all the pins
that are set up in a single game.

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:57.000
Pretty challenging for some lousy straps.

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:59.460
That's how rare they are.

00:03:59.460 --> 00:04:01.050
Hanzawa, did you choose your ball...

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:03.390
Kawafuji... I can't get it off...

00:04:04.470 --> 00:04:05.510
That one's for a kid!

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:08.430
Hanzawa's a pretty funny guy.

00:04:08.430 --> 00:04:11.270
Whatever... Just make sure
you don't injure your right hand.

00:04:11.270 --> 00:04:13.350
That was an "American joke," right?

00:04:13.350 --> 00:04:14.310
Use this one.

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:15.770
Uh, okay.

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:17.570
You'd think he was joking, right?

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:19.860
Anyone would have thought so.

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:28.700
Hanzawa!

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:31.960
You haven't bowled before, have you?

00:04:31.960 --> 00:04:33.500
It's been... a long while.

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:35.750
Your form isn't right.

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:38.340
Like this, then this. Got it?

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:39.300
Y-Yeah...

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:41.630
Now, roll it!

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:44.880
Hanzawa!

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:49.600
I'll cover him, so leave it all to me.

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:51.060
Whoa, your very own braces?

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:00.860
Yeah!

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:03.150
Yeah! That's our Kawa-chan!

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:06.910
Unlike me, Kawafuji is
really great at everything.

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:08.870
Thank you, Kawa-chan!

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:10.830
It's all because of you that I got Nana-chan!

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:12.410
Nothing to it.

00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:13.460
Next up, darts.

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:17.080
We can get Foo-chan by hitting
the bullseye three times in a row.

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:18.750
Another tough one.

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:20.550
I'll get it right this time!

00:05:20.550 --> 00:05:22.550
Do you know how to play darts, Hanzawa?

00:05:22.550 --> 00:05:25.260
Uh... Um... Yeah...

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:27.010
Good to know!

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:29.640
I'm really not good at it.

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:30.350
Huh?!

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:39.810
Sorry. Guess my shoulder wasn't warmed up.

00:05:39.810 --> 00:05:41.230
Seriously?!

00:05:41.230 --> 00:05:42.280
I'm counting on you, Hanzawa!

00:05:43.990 --> 00:05:47.030
Focus, focus, focus...

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:51.580
Don't overdo it.

00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:53.290
Focus!

00:05:56.330 --> 00:05:57.170
Oh?

00:05:57.170 --> 00:05:57.960
Whoa!

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:00.130
Kawafuji...

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:01.790
My arm...

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:03.550
What?! You serious?!

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:05.220
Another "American joke"!

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:07.340
Hanzawa got me the Foo-chan strap!

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:09.760
You must have used a muscle
you don't normally use.

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:11.050
Looks like the bone's okay.

00:06:12.010 --> 00:06:14.350
Don't worry—just let it out.

00:06:14.350 --> 00:06:16.100
I've never played basketball before...

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:17.100
What?!

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:19.810
You're joking, right?
It was a big trend in manga.

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:23.190
It's a standard recess game,
and we play it during PE, too.

00:06:23.190 --> 00:06:24.860
Is basketball really that big a deal?

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:25.400
Seriously, you have never played basketball?!

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:27.860
If such a thing can be true
of anyone, it's Handa.

00:06:29.110 --> 00:06:33.410
As focused as you are, you could have
been an awesome three-point shooter.

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:35.080
What a waste.

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:35.910
Sorry...

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:38.670
No need to apologize.
I was just a bit surprised.

00:06:38.670 --> 00:06:43.290
If you had such a fun friend, you should have
let me meet him sooner, Kawa-chan.

00:06:44.550 --> 00:06:45.050
Can't let him off the hook.

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:46.050
Hasegawa-kun...

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:47.920
...called me fun!
Huh? The heck do you mean by that?

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:48.300
...called me fun!

00:06:48.300 --> 00:06:49.880
He's such a nice guy!

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:52.680
Yeah!

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:55.140
Huh, as expected from basketball club boy.

00:06:55.140 --> 00:06:58.180
Maybe he'll become my friend!

00:06:58.180 --> 00:06:58.940
Hey!

00:07:04.070 --> 00:07:06.480
Aah... Triple's so cute...

00:07:06.480 --> 00:07:07.990
Lickey, lickey.

00:07:07.990 --> 00:07:09.820
That's gross. Stop with the licking.

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:13.320
I'm going to buy myself some juice.
I'll get soda and tea for you guys.

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:14.120
Thank you!

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:16.200
I'll go too.

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:18.370
You stay put and chat with Hasegawa.

00:07:18.960 --> 00:07:20.080
I see...

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:22.040
Kawafuji, I'm going to do my best!

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:24.170
Hanzawa, is there any idol you like?

00:07:25.300 --> 00:07:26.710
He's talking to me!

00:07:26.710 --> 00:07:30.010
I-I don't know too much about idols.

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:31.970
You haven't read any manga either, right?

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:34.600
J-Just the shorts in the newspaper.

00:07:34.600 --> 00:07:36.350
That's where everyone starts.

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:38.600
I'll let you borrow my
basketball manga next time.

00:07:38.600 --> 00:07:39.180
Huh?!

00:07:39.810 --> 00:07:41.850
So, this is the rumored
"borrowing and lending of manga"!

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:45.440
I know! I'll let you borrow my Triple DVD, too.

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:45.480
Ah... We're like friends...

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:47.980
They look real cute in their swimsuits.
Ah... We're like friends...

00:07:47.980 --> 00:07:49.860
So this is what having a friend is about.
The frills are really cute!

00:07:49.860 --> 00:07:50.150
So this is what having a friend is about.

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:51.650
Am I talking okay?

00:07:52.410 --> 00:07:53.820
I am, right?

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:57.870
I'm sure he would still accept me,
even if I were to disclose that I'm Handa...

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:00.580
Hasegawa-kun!

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:02.420
Ow... Watch where you're going!

00:08:02.420 --> 00:08:03.500
Huh?

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:05.250
You're that second-year student, Hasegawa.

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:06.840
You're so small I didn't see you.

00:08:06.840 --> 00:08:07.840
Senpai...

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:08.590
Senpai?

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:10.800
His basketball club seniors?

00:08:10.800 --> 00:08:13.430
So, Hasegawa, thanks to
supplementary exam prep,

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:16.970
you get free time to goof off in
a place like this... Must be nice.

00:08:16.970 --> 00:08:20.390
Oh, come now... You're here
having fun too, senpai.

00:08:20.390 --> 00:08:22.310
Don't talk back to your senpai!

00:08:23.230 --> 00:08:23.810
Hm?

00:08:24.730 --> 00:08:26.440
Ah! That's...!

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:27.820
Triple straps!

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:29.860
And all three of them!

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:32.400
Those are mine! I dropped them!

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:34.410
Well, lucky me.

00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:37.240
Locks like he got caught
by some pesky senpai...

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:39.830
Kawafuji... Where's Kawafuji?

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:41.960
Please, anything but that!

00:08:41.960 --> 00:08:45.210
My friends got them for me!

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:46.920
I'm your friend too, right?

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:47.670
Rin-Rin! Foo-chan!

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:49.920
You want a punch from your dear senpai?

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:52.260
C'mon! Give them back!

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:53.630
Why, you...!

00:08:55.890 --> 00:09:00.600
The only thing I can do is distract his senpai.

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:04.100
I won't let them lay a finger
on Hasegawa-kun—no...

00:09:04.100 --> 00:09:05.400
Give them back!

00:09:05.400 --> 00:09:05.600
...on my friend!

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:07.650
You need to practice a bit more, Hasegawa!

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:08.980
Ow! Who did that?!

00:09:11.070 --> 00:09:13.610
Now then... The guy who
everyone hates is here!

00:09:14.780 --> 00:09:16.320
If they want to punch someone,
they can come and punch me!

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:18.370
Handa?!

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:21.080
"Punch me, not Hasegawa-kun"

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:24.500
Damn it... He's saying he's gonna kill us
if we keep teasing Hasegawa.

00:09:26.370 --> 00:09:27.500
Here you go.

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:29.040
Sorry 'bout that, Hasegawa.

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:29.790
Laters.

00:09:30.340 --> 00:09:32.300
You should have told us you knew Handa!

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:35.050
Of course I don't know him...

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:38.430
Handa-kun...

00:09:39.220 --> 00:09:42.140
You know, there was a cute girl
at the drink bar, and...

00:09:43.220 --> 00:09:45.640
Don't think you know me just
because of what happened here.

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:48.440
Handa... kun...

00:09:55.070 --> 00:09:55.900
What happened?

00:09:55.900 --> 00:09:57.450
Kawa-chan, you're late!

00:09:57.450 --> 00:09:59.370
Handa... Handa was here before me!

00:09:59.370 --> 00:10:01.030
You should have seen his aura!

00:10:01.030 --> 00:10:03.580
Uh, okay... So, where's Hanzawa?

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:04.750
Hanzawa?

00:10:04.750 --> 00:10:06.250
Like I'd know!

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:08.960
Anyway, Handa was so cool!

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:11.040
I felt like I was some sort of heroine!

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:11.840
Where's Hanzawa?

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:12.500
Dunno!

00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:15.130
Hasegawa-kun is going to be hated on
if he gets involved with me.

00:10:15.760 --> 00:10:17.130
I need to protect my friends.

00:10:18.510 --> 00:10:20.470
"The next day"

00:10:20.800 --> 00:10:21.640
Whoops.

00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:27.730
Are you all right?

00:10:27.730 --> 00:10:28.440
Yeah...

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:29.440
Ha—

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:31.360
Handa-kun...!

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:32.980
Hasegawa-kun!

00:10:35.490 --> 00:10:37.820
And just after you told me
not to think I knew you!

00:10:37.820 --> 00:10:39.530
I'm so stupid!

00:10:39.530 --> 00:10:42.490
Stupid, stupid, stupid...

00:10:42.490 --> 00:10:44.580
Yeah, I should have expected this...

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:50.830
And so, Handa's lack of trust in
other people kept getting worse.

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:51.380
Hasegawa
Kawa-chan,
lend these to Hanzawa!

00:10:51.380 --> 00:10:52.920
Or at least, that's trow it seemed.

00:10:53.460 --> 00:10:59.880
As promised, Hasegawa lent his basketball
manga to "Hanzawa," which eased him a bit.

00:11:05.220 --> 00:11:07.810
His name is Higashino Koutaro.

00:11:08.270 --> 00:11:10.390
The 100-meter ace of the Track and Field club.

00:11:11.150 --> 00:11:14.570
No one in school stands a chance
against this super high-school sprinter.

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:17.070
He's so fast that he gained the nickname...

00:11:17.650 --> 00:11:18.900
...Dash Higashino.

00:11:19.860 --> 00:11:21.860
Dash-kun, nice to see you working out so early.

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:23.490
<i>"Handa-kun and Dash Higashino"</i>

00:11:23.490 --> 00:11:25.080
I'm on top of my game today again!

00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:28.500
Really, it's a waste to see you
in a lower-class team like ours.

00:11:29.410 --> 00:11:30.580
Don't say that.

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:34.670
My heroic tale of refusing offers from schools
with elite track and field teams is because...

00:11:34.670 --> 00:11:36.210
Don't overstate what I said.

00:11:37.260 --> 00:11:39.050
Yes, it's because of...

00:11:40.720 --> 00:11:41.970
...Handa Sei!

00:11:42.590 --> 00:11:44.930
I need him to grovel at my feet in defeat!

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:48.390
Handa made me taste the
misery of defeat once before.

00:11:48.890 --> 00:11:51.640
It's excruciating to even think of it,
but back in spring at middle school...

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:57.440
I had to race Handa, but I had a sharp
stomachache, as if I'd had an appendectomy.

00:11:58.110 --> 00:11:58.480
On the other hand,
Handa was on top of his game.

00:11:58.480 --> 00:12:00.610
Dash Higashino Vision

00:12:00.610 --> 00:12:04.120
He probably doped himself
in fear of losing to me.

00:12:04.120 --> 00:12:05.120
Ready...

00:12:07.740 --> 00:12:11.410
He kept interfering with my running
during the entire course of the race.

00:12:14.790 --> 00:12:15.540
Goal!

00:12:15.540 --> 00:12:18.090
He doped himself! He jumped the gun!

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:19.880
What a cheat! I would never lose!

00:12:19.880 --> 00:12:22.430
Handa-kun was running like everyone else.

00:12:22.430 --> 00:12:24.390
Stop making things up.

00:12:25.010 --> 00:12:26.300
You're pretty fast.

00:12:26.300 --> 00:12:27.260
Really?

00:12:27.260 --> 00:12:32.060
I, as the innocent middle schooler,
lost to Handa's dirty scheming.

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:34.440
Don't think you'll get away with it!

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:39.820
Today is the day I'm going to challenge Handa,
fair and square, to a 100-meter race!

00:12:43.200 --> 00:12:44.320
He noticed?!

00:12:44.320 --> 00:12:46.370
Why is he so pissed?!

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:51.000
I'm sorry! I won't follow you again!

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:53.750
I left my notes in the classroom.

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:57.540
The trauma I bore was
much deeper than I thought.

00:12:57.540 --> 00:12:58.420
I'm so pathetic!

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:01.460
I couldn't speak to him, not even once,
because of how scared I am!

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:03.130
Han—!

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:06.470
Looks like you're obsessed with Handa-kun, too.

00:13:07.010 --> 00:13:08.350
Are you stupid?!

00:13:08.350 --> 00:13:10.060
I'm not obsessed!

00:13:10.060 --> 00:13:13.810
I'm just trying to find the right time
to challenge Handa to a 100-meter race!

00:13:13.810 --> 00:13:16.350
Yeah, you're obsessed, all right.

00:13:16.350 --> 00:13:18.440
I just want him to race me!

00:13:19.020 --> 00:13:20.400
But when those eyes glare at me,

00:13:20.400 --> 00:13:23.280
my heart pounds like crazy
and I go into a cold sweat.

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:24.780
And I can't hold back my tears...

00:13:24.780 --> 00:13:26.660
That's a severe case of Handa Disease!

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:26.740
Handa Disease

00:13:26.740 --> 00:13:26.820
Disease

00:13:26.820 --> 00:13:28.530
A lot of our grade students have that.

00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:31.370
In that case, I may be of some help to you.

00:13:33.120 --> 00:13:37.080
While we're at it, why don't you do
some test runs imagining me to be him?

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:38.460
Uh, okay?

00:13:38.960 --> 00:13:41.750
If there's any other Handa
besides Handa himself,

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:42.300
it would have to be...

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:43.130
On your mark...

00:13:43.460 --> 00:13:44.130
Get set...

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:45.420
...me!

00:13:53.520 --> 00:13:56.020
Higashino! That was 10.87 seconds!

00:13:56.020 --> 00:13:58.770
Higashino-kun! You're too fast!

00:13:58.770 --> 00:14:00.730
Thanks to you, that was my best time yet!

00:14:02.570 --> 00:14:05.030
What do you have to do to run that fast?

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:06.110
Easy!

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:10.370
Just imagine you're being chased by
the thing that scares you the most.

00:14:10.370 --> 00:14:12.450
Huh, talking like a real genius there.

00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:19.380
If you can't challenge Handa-kun,
why not make a situation leading to a race?

00:14:19.380 --> 00:14:20.460
Situation?

00:14:23.090 --> 00:14:25.970
But how can I make Handa run 100 meters?

00:14:25.970 --> 00:14:29.970
Why not have something really scary chase him?

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:32.470
Be quiet in the halls!!

00:14:32.470 --> 00:14:35.350
Fire! Run!

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:37.520
Now run, Handa!

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:39.190
I'll run right past you!

00:14:43.150 --> 00:14:45.280
Everyone! Follow Handa!

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:46.610
Remember the three "nos"!

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:47.190
Guess that fake Handa needs to
be punched for giving me that idea.

00:14:47.190 --> 00:14:49.030
No pushing, no running, no talking!

00:14:49.030 --> 00:14:50.740
Guess that fake Handa needs to
be punched for giving me that idea.

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:56.250
Dash-kun.

00:14:56.250 --> 00:14:59.710
I heard you faked a fire and
got scolded by the Principal.

00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:00.920
Manager...

00:15:01.460 --> 00:15:04.250
Why don't you just forget
about Handa-kun already?

00:15:04.670 --> 00:15:07.510
If you keep this up,
you're going to ruin your life.

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:10.590
Running is your only talent!

00:15:10.590 --> 00:15:13.100
Are you going to let that talent,
and your only chance

00:15:13.100 --> 00:15:15.100
at a livelihood, go to waste
because of Handa-kun?!

00:15:20.350 --> 00:15:21.520
Come to think of it...

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:24.900
...these past two years in
the Track and Field club,

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:28.030
the only thing I've improved on
has been my Handa-tracking skills.

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:31.530
Am I... veering off-track?

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:34.030
You have friends here with you.

00:15:35.200 --> 00:15:36.660
Heeey!

00:15:36.660 --> 00:15:38.830
We're gonna do some sprints!

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:42.540
We may be a lower-class team,
but everyone here needs you.

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:44.340
My... friends!

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:47.760
Let's all do our best and get better,
like some drama based on youthful days!

00:15:47.760 --> 00:15:50.550
Run, run, and run all the way, Dash-kun!

00:15:51.680 --> 00:15:52.380
I see...

00:15:53.090 --> 00:15:54.680
There's another path for me to tread!

00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:58.850
I'm going to take this team to the Nationals!

00:16:01.310 --> 00:16:03.980
The real Dash Higashino starts now!

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:07.400
Huh? Isn't that Handa?

00:16:07.820 --> 00:16:09.570
That's the first time I've seen him run like that!

00:16:11.450 --> 00:16:12.660
Uh, he's pretty darn fast.

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:14.910
No! Dash-kun!

00:16:17.120 --> 00:16:19.750
Today is the day I'm going to
beat Handa, no matter what!

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:22.160
That's what my youth is about!

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:24.460
The sense of being chased by something scary...

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:29.670
That fake Handa made me remember
that sense I'd forgotten for so long.

00:16:29.670 --> 00:16:33.680
My days of chasing you,
my number-one fear, will end today!

00:16:34.510 --> 00:16:37.760
Now it's your turn to chase my back!

00:16:40.180 --> 00:16:42.180
What?! He's retiring?!

00:16:45.270 --> 00:16:46.650
Why was Handa running?!

00:16:47.570 --> 00:16:51.530
He must have been...
chased by something terrifying.

00:16:59.200 --> 00:17:01.500
Oh my, Josephine!

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:03.250
Don't run off like that.

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:05.500
You're usually a good boy,
but the heat of mating is getting to you.

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:05.710
Slap, slap, slap...
You're usually a good boy,
but the heat of mating is getting to you.

00:17:05.710 --> 00:17:07.960
Bad boy, Josephine! Bad boy!
Slap, slap, slap...

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:09.630
Slap, slap, slap...

00:17:11.510 --> 00:17:12.340
There's...

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:16.720
There's no doubt that he
turned me into a piece of bait...

00:17:17.470 --> 00:17:18.550
Handa!

00:17:19.050 --> 00:17:20.510
You'll pay!

00:17:21.310 --> 00:17:25.310
And so, Dash Higashino's
inferior complexity only deepened.

00:17:27.690 --> 00:17:30.770
I was chased by a huge dog today.

00:17:30.770 --> 00:17:34.700
It looks like some guy from the Track and Field
team was attacked instead after I escaped.

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:38.030
Isn't that the Dash Higashino guy
you were with back in middle school?

00:17:38.780 --> 00:17:40.490
You know, the guy who's always following you.

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:42.580
Dash?

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:44.160
Who's that?

00:17:44.710 --> 00:17:46.750
You're the worst...

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:53.010
I introduced myself to palmistry after being
influenced by TV into reading my friend's palm.

00:17:53.630 --> 00:17:57.470
Miyo-chan is a single-minded type of person.

00:17:57.470 --> 00:17:59.850
You're right! You're amazing, Tsugumi-chan!

00:18:00.430 --> 00:18:05.270
I get attached to things easily, so it was easy
for me to get attached to fortune-telling.

00:18:05.270 --> 00:18:05.770
Fortune

00:18:05.770 --> 00:18:06.480
Before I knew it, I became known in school as
a fortune-teller whose readings were accurate.
Fortune

00:18:06.480 --> 00:18:10.230
Before I knew it, I became known in school as
a fortune-teller whose readings were accurate.

00:18:11.570 --> 00:18:13.940
Did you start learning something?
Calligraphy, maybe?

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:15.490
How did you know?

00:18:16.070 --> 00:18:19.450
Tsugumi-chan, you should really
become a professional fortune-teller!

00:18:19.450 --> 00:18:21.240
Come on, me?

00:18:21.700 --> 00:18:24.160
Well, it's not like that hasn't crossed my mind.

00:18:25.370 --> 00:18:29.170
If only there were someone on whom
I could test my mettle as a fortune-teller.

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:32.380
You want to read Handa-kun's palm?

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:35.300
<i>"Handa-kun and Palmistry"
That's gonna be tough.</i>

00:18:35.300 --> 00:18:35.670
<i>"Handa-kun and Palmistry"</i>

00:18:35.670 --> 00:18:38.680
Handa-kun doesn't believe in fortune-telling,
so that's not going to happen.

00:18:38.680 --> 00:18:41.800
But you know, Tsugumi-chan is
a well-known fortune-teller.

00:18:41.800 --> 00:18:43.560
I wouldn't mind you reading my palm.

00:18:43.560 --> 00:18:47.940
Reo-kun is fickle, stupid, flashy,
and can't read moods, right?

00:18:47.940 --> 00:18:50.190
Huh? I thought you were going to read my palm.

00:18:50.190 --> 00:18:54.230
This Week's Fortune

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:56.150
This week's fortune is...

00:18:57.440 --> 00:18:57.650
Aries

00:18:57.650 --> 00:19:01.410
"Too bad. It looks like something
unexpected will leave you in shock.

00:19:01.990 --> 00:19:04.540
You can bring luck to your side
by being helpful to others."

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:09.750
Even if you don't believe in fortunes,
they can still bother you.

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:12.540
So, why do you want to read Handa's palm?

00:19:12.540 --> 00:19:14.920
What's going on?
Why are they talking about me?

00:19:14.920 --> 00:19:19.220
Fortune-telling is based on statistics, so I want
to read as many people's palms as I can.

00:19:19.220 --> 00:19:24.560
I also want to read the palms of a very
popular person and of someone really hated.

00:19:24.560 --> 00:19:25.760
I see...

00:19:26.680 --> 00:19:28.680
You can bring luck
to your side by being
helpful to others

00:19:30.640 --> 00:19:34.400
Well, if showing my palm
is going to help someone,

00:19:34.400 --> 00:19:36.190
I suppose I can let her read it.

00:19:37.070 --> 00:19:38.320
What an unnatural way to sleep.

00:19:39.780 --> 00:19:42.660
Maybe he overheard us.

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:45.240
That's why he's putting his palm out like that?

00:19:45.240 --> 00:19:46.410
Is this okay?

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:48.330
Is this pose unnatural?

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:51.040
Now then, if you'll excuse me.

00:19:52.580 --> 00:19:53.960
The palm...!

00:19:53.960 --> 00:19:55.750
What, what? What's the matter?

00:19:56.250 --> 00:19:58.090
What... What...

00:19:58.920 --> 00:20:00.550
What a normal-looking palm!

00:20:01.550 --> 00:20:03.970
I can't find the Simian Line
that I thought would be there.

00:20:03.970 --> 00:20:05.550
The line showing popularity is frail, too.

00:20:05.550 --> 00:20:06.970
Stop writing already!

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:08.140
That's so unnerving...

00:20:08.140 --> 00:20:11.230
She's proving herself as a fortune-teller
by not holding back on Handa.

00:20:11.230 --> 00:20:13.440
But I can tell one thing very clearly...

00:20:13.980 --> 00:20:15.230
His palm reads...

00:20:16.270 --> 00:20:18.940
...that he has an extreme level of paranoia.

00:20:19.360 --> 00:20:20.490
How was it?

00:20:20.490 --> 00:20:22.490
Bet you haven't seen a palm like his before!

00:20:23.070 --> 00:20:23.780
What to do...?

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:25.780
I didn't expect it to be so normal.

00:20:26.490 --> 00:20:28.450
Rather, it was borderline bad.

00:20:28.450 --> 00:20:32.710
I can't, for the love of it,
say something disappointing like that.

00:20:32.710 --> 00:20:33.870
Handa-kun...

00:20:34.380 --> 00:20:36.750
...bears a very harsh fate.

00:20:39.510 --> 00:20:41.550
Seriously?! I knew it!

00:20:41.550 --> 00:20:42.880
How harsh?!

00:20:42.880 --> 00:20:45.090
How...?

00:20:45.090 --> 00:20:46.760
I don't have details, but...

00:20:47.640 --> 00:20:50.020
L-Like eternal solitude?

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:53.560
Or like going against the odds...

00:20:54.020 --> 00:20:55.940
Or traveling across a never-ending desert...

00:20:55.940 --> 00:20:58.150
Wow, you got that right, Tsugu-chan!

00:20:58.150 --> 00:21:00.400
He's a loner, and he also
fights against the odds!

00:21:00.400 --> 00:21:02.780
He's traveling his very life now!

00:21:02.780 --> 00:21:05.910
How can they be so happy hearing
about someone's misfortune?!

00:21:06.410 --> 00:21:08.410
Can you read Handa's future?

00:21:08.410 --> 00:21:09.280
Future?

00:21:10.120 --> 00:21:13.250
Palms can change, but I can read
maybe five or six years in the future.

00:21:15.170 --> 00:21:16.960
There's no line saying he'll get married,

00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:19.460
but I still see a future where
he's surrounded by kids.

00:21:20.210 --> 00:21:21.260
I see five children.

00:21:21.260 --> 00:21:23.510
No... More than seven?!

00:21:23.510 --> 00:21:26.050
So many children, despite not
having a single ounce of sex drive?!

00:21:26.050 --> 00:21:27.890
What's with this labyrinth?!

00:21:27.890 --> 00:21:29.100
It's the Labyrinth of Handa!

00:21:29.100 --> 00:21:29.970
So?

00:21:30.600 --> 00:21:34.480
I learned fortune-telling on my own,
so I can't be that sure.

00:21:34.480 --> 00:21:36.520
Come now, no need to be so humble!

00:21:36.520 --> 00:21:38.190
C'mon, tell us an awesome future!

00:21:38.690 --> 00:21:39.860
All I can say is...

00:21:41.980 --> 00:21:45.450
...Handa-kun won't live a decent life.

00:21:47.320 --> 00:21:48.990
I was arrogant...

00:21:49.870 --> 00:21:53.910
I'm still a novice, not being able
to read Handa-kun's palm properly.

00:21:55.370 --> 00:22:00.420
I won't be able to become a real fortune-teller
if I can't speak the results with confidence.

00:22:01.550 --> 00:22:05.260
Handa-kun set himself up to teach me that.

00:22:06.260 --> 00:22:07.800
Thank you, Handa-kun.

00:22:17.960 --> 00:22:21.820
Don't look for me- Don't look for me-

00:22:21.820 --> 00:22:25.110
I'd rather not register in anyone's gaze,

00:22:25.110 --> 00:22:31.290
'Cause I'm still not settled into this world.

00:22:33.350 --> 00:22:37.170
Though I'm so transient, I've always said,

00:22:37.250 --> 00:22:42.420
"Someday, this unfair way of living will come back to bite me!"

00:22:42.460 --> 00:22:46.680
'Cause what I really want,

00:22:46.800 --> 00:22:50.390
Is to be laughing along with everyone else!

00:22:50.470 --> 00:22:54.350
My HIDE-AND-SEEK continues...

00:22:54.430 --> 00:22:58.610
My voice still can't make a sound,

00:23:00.850 --> 00:23:06.200
But I wonder if I can communicate this... all my thoughts and feelings!

00:23:06.200 --> 00:23:11.370
I can always hear it in the distance...

00:23:11.370 --> 00:23:19.040
And someday, I'd like to once again answer that call.

00:23:19.090 --> 00:23:22.250
The day when I'll be told, "It's alright, you've done all you can,"

00:23:22.250 --> 00:23:26.510
May be closer to arribing than I thought.

00:23:41.650 --> 00:23:42.770
I'm done for...

00:23:43.610 --> 00:23:44.730
Life is too harsh...

00:23:46.230 --> 00:23:48.860
I bet she said that because
she knew you were awake.

00:23:48.860 --> 00:23:49.400
Huh?

00:23:50.070 --> 00:23:55.580
She actually had good results, but she probably
said something bad just to trouble you.

00:23:56.950 --> 00:23:58.500
Ah, that makes sense!

00:23:59.250 --> 00:24:00.910
I am hated after all!

00:24:00.910 --> 00:24:02.460
Right? Have more confidence in yourself.

00:24:02.460 --> 00:24:04.710
What a relief to know I'm hated!

00:24:05.590 --> 00:24:08.920
This is all way too weird to comprehend...
